{"sections":[{"chapter":"Use of first components provided by OUDS","projectFiles":"OUDS-Discovery-Tutorial.zip","xcodeRequirement":"Xcode 26.5","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS provides components ready to be used, specified in Figma assets and preventing users to handle tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They are rendered thanks to the theme in use."}]}],"estimatedTimeInMinutes":30,"kind":"hero","title":"Use your first OUDS components","backgroundImage":"ic_component_intro.png","image":"ic_component_intro.png"},{"tasks":[{"contentSection":[{"kind":"contentAndMedia","mediaPosition":"trailing","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We will work on a kind of formular using main OUDS components."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Feel free to style and design things as you want."}]}]}],"title":"Add basic components","stepsSection":[{"caption":[],"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"First, prepare the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ContentView"},{"type":"text","text":" by adding inside it a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScrollView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"media":null,"runtimePreview":null,"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-1.swift"},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add such picker with three items inside."}]}],"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Now, let’s add radio buttons to let the user choose its gender."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The official components are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSRadio"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSRadioItem"},{"type":"text","text":", but the package has also a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSRadioPicker"},{"type":"text","text":" to implement quicky a group of radios."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This component can be replaced by your own."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The radio picker is defined by an array of values to display radio items associated to a tag, i.e. an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hashable"},{"type":"text","text":" thing shared through a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Binding"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Inside a picker the user can select only one value, not zero."}]}],"media":null,"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-2.png","code":"tutorial-discovery-3-2.swift"},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add a checkbox item with only two states."}]}],"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The radio picker is alone, it is the time to add below a checkbox. OUDS provides two components: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCheckbox"},{"type":"text","text":" which is a simple checkbox, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCheckboxItem"},{"type":"text","text":" which is a checkbox (duh!) with additional texts and icons."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The state of the checkbox is shared through a boolean "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"State"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In some cases you may need to use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCheckboxIndeterminate"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate"},{"type":"text","text":" if you want a three-states checkbox."}]}],"media":null,"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-3.png","code":"tutorial-discovery-3-3.swift"},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose to add an instance of "},{"code":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There are also components who do not have any behaviors and are here only for visual rendering, for example dividers which can be horizontal or vertical."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A divider is, in the end, a stroke with a color. You will see later, colors in OUDS have two values: a light mode value, and a dark mode value. Here the divider can have a color which can change, or not."}]}],"media":null,"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-4.png","code":"tutorial-discovery-3-4.swift"},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add a switch item, it will be used as a trick to force the change of the color scheme for the view for our future operations."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You will then be able to see the automatic changes of colors when you switch the color scheme."}]}],"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With radio and checkbox, OUDS provides also switch elements (toggles). They can be alone ("},{"code":"OUDSSwitch","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") or with texts ("},{"code":"OUDSSwitchItem","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Just like the checkbox, the switch exposes its state through a "},{"code":"Binding","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"media":null,"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-5.png","code":"tutorial-discovery-3-5.swift"},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add an "},{"code":"OUDSLink","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the app and make it open the iOS documentation OUDS website."}]}],"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Users may need to navigate outside the app, like, for example, opening a website. Thus the "},{"code":"OUDSLink","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" component can be integrated. It can be only with a text or also a chevron indicator."}]}],"media":null,"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-6.png","code":"tutorial-discovery-3-6.swift"},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Let’s add a button with some rules: if checkbox is not checked it is disabled. When tapped, change the style of the button during 5 seconds."}]}],"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the end, we can also add a button. Button are one of the most used components in an app and bring a lof of the power and the style of the brand."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can find it with the "},{"code":"OUDSButton","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Such button has an appearance changing its colors, and also a style (loading or not)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thanks to the theme, the enabled, disabled, hover, focus or pressed states are managed."}]}],"media":null,"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-7.png","code":"tutorial-discovery-3-7.swift"}],"anchor":"Add-basic-components"}],"kind":"tasks"},{"anchor":"Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessments","assessments":[{"type":"multiple-choice","choices":[{"isCorrect":false,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}],"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No! The components use the design specifications, i.e. tokens, thanks to the theme, to define the style they must have in all cases."}]}]},{"isCorrect":true,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}]}],"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That is the reason why the "},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is so important: it injects the theme as environment variable so that any component can get it to define its style."}]}]}],"title":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Does the developer using OUDS component need to manage the look and feel of the components?"}]}],"content":[]}]},{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Components can be similar to iOS native components, or can also be original and strongly related to Orange Unified Design System needs."}],"featuredEyebrow":"Tutorial","kind":"callToAction","title":"Add more OUDS components","action":{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"Get started","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components"}}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components"},"metadata":{"category":"Orange Unified Design System","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","role":"project","title":"Use your first OUDS components"},"kind":"project","hierarchy":{"modules":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-librairies","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies","sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies#Check-Your-Understanding"}]}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Preparation-of-the-theme","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme#Basic-structure-for-the-app"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme#Check-Your-Understanding"}]}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Use-of-first-components-provided-by-OUDS","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components","sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components#Add-basic-components"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components#Check-Your-Understanding"}]}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Richer-and-more-original-components-of-OUDS","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components#Add-basic-components"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components#Check-Your-Understanding"}]}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Typography,-view-modifiers-and-tokens","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things","sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-tokens"},{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-view-modifiers"},{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Final-result"},{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Want-to-be-an-artist"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Check-Your-Understanding"}]}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Go-further-with-more-ressources","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further","sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further#More-resources"}]}]}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/$volume","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Use-of-first-components-provided-by-OUDS"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"OUDS-Discovery-Tutorial.zip":{"identifier":"OUDS-Discovery-Tutorial.zip","checksum":"8571308719e9a39981f2bca74adb703f54f0297ddb11b1fb7ed6d8cd6f2942596497af33da1cd76dc91c4d9a7f69546b3b29afce4066675267bfab1b3dca91d5","type":"download","url":"\/downloads\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDS-Discovery-Tutorial.zip"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)/Typography,-view-modifiers-and-tokens":{"url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)\/typography,-view-modifiers-and-tokens","kind":"article","type":"topic","abstract":[],"role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Typography,-view-modifiers-and-tokens","title":"Typography, view modifiers and tokens"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-librairies":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-librairies","role":"article","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)\/import-of-the-swift-package-and-choose-its-librairies","kind":"article","title":"Import of the Swift Package and choose its librairies"},"tutorial-discovery-3-7.png":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-7.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-7.png","type":"image","alt":"A radio picker, an horizontal divider, a checkbox item, a switch item, a link and a button"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things":{"title":"Styling things","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things","kind":"project","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Even if components increase the identity of your apps, it is not enough. Typography, fonts and tokens are here to improve that."}],"estimatedTime":"30min","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things","role":"project"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)/Richer-and-more-original-components-of-OUDS":{"title":"Richer and more original components of OUDS","kind":"article","url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)\/richer-and-more-original-components-of-ouds","abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Richer-and-more-original-components-of-OUDS","role":"article"},"tutorial-discovery-3-2.swift":{"content":["import OUDSSwiftUI","import SwiftUI","","struct ContentView: View {","","    @State var selectedGender: Genders = .male","","    var body: some View {","        OUDSRadioPicker(selection: $selectedGender,","                        radios: genderRadioValues(),","                        placement: .horizontal(false))","    }","","    \/\/ MARK: - Utils","","    enum Genders: String, Hashable {","        case male","        case female","        case nonBinary","    }","","    func genderRadioValues() -> [OUDSRadioPickerData<Genders>] {","        [","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.male, label: \"Mr\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.female, label: \"Ms\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.nonBinary, label: \"Other\"),","        ]","    }","}"],"fileType":"swift","fileName":"Content.swift","type":"file","identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-2.swift","syntax":"swift","highlights":[]},"tutorial-discovery-3-7.swift":{"content":["import OUDSSwiftUI","import SwiftUI","","struct ContentView: View {","","    @State var selectedGender: Genders = .male","    @State var termsAccepted: Bool = false","    @State var switchToDarkMode: Bool = false","    @State var creatingProfile: Bool = false","","    @Environment(\\.openURL) var openUrl","","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            OUDSRadioPicker(selection: $selectedGender,","                            radios: genderRadioValues(),","                            placement: .horizontal(false))","","            OUDSHorizontalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","","            OUDSCheckboxItem(\"I accept the terms of use\", isOn: $termsAccepted)","","            OUDSSwitchItem(\"Switch to dark mode\", isOn: $switchToDarkMode)","","            OUDSLink(text: \"Go to the website\", indicator: .next) {","                openUrl.callAsFunction(URL(string: \"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\")!)","            }","","            OUDSButton(text: \"Create my profile\",","                       appearance: .strong,","                       style: creatingProfile ? .loading : .default)","            {","                creatingProfile = true","                DispatchQueue.main.asyncAfter(deadline: .now() + 5) {","                    creatingProfile = false","                }","            }.disabled(!termsAccepted)","        }.preferredColorScheme(switchToDarkMode ? .dark : .light)","    }","","    \/\/ MARK: - Utils","","    enum Genders: String, Hashable {","        case male","        case female","        case nonBinary","    }","","    func genderRadioValues() -> [OUDSRadioPickerData<Genders>] {","        [","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.male, label: \"Mr\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.female, label: \"Ms\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.nonBinary, label: \"Other\"),","        ]","    }","}"],"fileType":"swift","identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-7.swift","fileName":"Content.swift","type":"file","syntax":"swift","highlights":[{"line":9},{"line":28},{"line":29},{"line":30},{"line":31},{"line":32},{"line":33},{"line":34},{"line":35},{"line":36},{"line":37}]},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-tokens":{"title":"Use of tokens","kind":"section","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-tokens","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Even if components increase the identity of your apps, it is not enough. Typography, fonts and tokens are here to improve that."}],"type":"section","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-tokens","role":"pseudoSymbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components":{"title":"Use your first OUDS components","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components","kind":"project","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS provides components ready to be used, specified in Figma assets and preventing users to handle tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They are rendered thanks to the theme in use."}],"estimatedTime":"30min","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components","role":"project"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)/Preparation-of-the-theme":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Preparation-of-the-theme","role":"article","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)\/preparation-of-the-theme","kind":"article","title":"Preparation of the theme"},"tutorial-discovery-3-3.swift":{"fileType":"swift","content":["import OUDSSwiftUI","import SwiftUI","","struct ContentView: View {","","    @State var selectedGender: Genders = .male","    @State var termsAccepted: Bool = false","","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            OUDSRadioPicker(selection: $selectedGender,","                            radios: genderRadioValues(),","                            placement: .horizontal(false))","","            OUDSCheckboxItem(\"I accept the terms of use\", isOn: $termsAccepted)","        }","    }","","    \/\/ MARK: - Utils","","    enum Genders: String, Hashable {","        case male","        case female","        case nonBinary","    }","","    func genderRadioValues() -> [OUDSRadioPickerData<Genders>] {","        [","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.male, label: \"Mr\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.female, label: \"Ms\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.nonBinary, label: \"Other\"),","        ]","    }","}"],"identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-3.swift","fileName":"Content.swift","type":"file","syntax":"swift","highlights":[{"line":7},{"line":10},{"line":11},{"line":12},{"line":13},{"line":14},{"line":15},{"line":16}]},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)/Use-of-first-components-provided-by-OUDS":{"title":"Use of first components provided by OUDS","url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)\/use-of-first-components-provided-by-ouds","kind":"article","abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Use-of-first-components-provided-by-OUDS","role":"article"},"tutorial-discovery-3-4.swift":{"fileType":"swift","content":["import OUDSSwiftUI","import SwiftUI","","struct ContentView: View {","","    @State var selectedGender: Genders = .male","    @State var termsAccepted: Bool = false","","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            OUDSRadioPicker(selection: $selectedGender,","                            radios: genderRadioValues(),","                            placement: .horizontal(false))","","            OUDSHorizontalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","","            OUDSCheckboxItem(\"I accept the terms of use\", isOn: $termsAccepted)","        }","    }","","    \/\/ MARK: - Utils","","    enum Genders: String, Hashable {","        case male","        case female","        case nonBinary","    }","","    func genderRadioValues() -> [OUDSRadioPickerData<Genders>] {","        [","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.male, label: \"Mr\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.female, label: \"Ms\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.nonBinary, label: \"Other\"),","        ]","    }","}"],"fileName":"Content.swift","type":"file","identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-4.swift","syntax":"swift","highlights":[{"line":15},{"line":16}]},"tutorial-discovery-3-3.png":{"identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-3.png","alt":"A radio picker and a checkbox item","type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-3.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"tutorial-discovery-3-5.png":{"identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-5.png","alt":"A radio picker, an horizontal divider, a checkbox item and a switch item","type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-5.png","traits":["1x